      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "NO synthase was studied in intact rats and in rats with bronchial asthma epitheliocytes after inhalation of phenotherol, propranolol, guanosine triphosphate (GTP) and combined inhalation of GTP with phenotherol. NO synthase mediator action on bronchial patency during adrenoagonists and GTP inhalation was demonstrated."},
